{
  "id": "app_flexplay",
  "title": "Manual: Flexplay",
  "parent": "biblioteca_apps",
  "description": "Novo aplicativo rápido e moderno, disponível para Smart TVs LG e aparelhos com sistema Roku.",
  "content": {
    "type": "text",
    "data": "<div class='space-y-10 animate-fadeIn'><div class='bg-indigo-600/10 border-l-4 border-indigo-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-indigo-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-play-circle'></i> Novo Aplicativo Recomendado</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>O Flexplay é uma excelente opção para Smart TVs LG e sistema Roku (AOC, Philco, Semp TCL e Express).</p></div><div class='flex justify-center mb-10'><div class='w-48 h-48 bg-black rounded-[2.5rem] flex items-center justify-center p-4 border border-gray-800 shadow-2xl'><img src='/shared_assets/logo/logo-flexplay.jpg' class='w-full h-full object-contain rounded-2xl'></div></div><section class='bg-[#1c2128] border-2 border-indigo-500/20 p-8 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-2xl'><div class='flex items-center gap-4 mb-6'><div class='w-12 h-12 bg-indigo-600/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400'><i class='fas fa-sign-in-alt'></i></div><div><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase text-sm tracking-tighter'>Como Fazer Login</h4><p class='text-[10px] text-gray-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest'>Autenticação por Código (Provider Code)</p></div></div><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6'>Assim como o HD Player, o Flexplay exige um código especial para se conectar ao nosso servidor, além do seu Usuário e Senha normais. Utilize um dos códigos abaixo no campo <b>Provider Code / Código</b>:</p><div class='grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-6'><div class='bg-[#0d1117] border border-indigo-500/30 p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-inner'><p class='text-[8px] text-indigo-400 font-black uppercase mb-1'>Principal</p><h2 class='text-xl font-black text-white'>4100</h2></div><div class='bg-[#0d1117] border border-gray-800 p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-inner'><p class='text-[8px] text-gray-500 font-black uppercase mb-1'>Internacional</p><h2 class='text-xl font-black text-white'>4101</h2></div><div class='bg-[#0d1117] border border-gray-800 p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-inner'><p class='text-[8px] text-gray-500 font-black uppercase mb-1'>Alternativo R2</p><h2 class='text-xl font-black text-white'>4102</h2></div><div class='bg-[#0d1117] border border-gray-800 p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-inner'><p class='text-[8px] text-gray-500 font-black uppercase mb-1'>Alternativo R3</p><h2 class='text-xl font-black text-white'>4103</h2></div></div><div class='bg-[#0d1117] border border-gray-800 p-4 rounded-2xl text-center shadow-inner md:w-1/4 mx-auto'><p class='text-[8px] text-gray-500 font-black uppercase mb-1'>Alternativo R4</p><h2 class='text-xl font-black text-white'>4104</h2></div></section><div class='bg-emerald-600/10 border border-emerald-500/20 p-6 rounded-3xl mt-10'><p class='text-emerald-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-tv'></i> Instalação</p><ul class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-4 space-y-2 list-disc ml-5'><li><b>Na LG:</b> Acesse a Content Store, pesquise por \"Flexplay\" e instale.</li><li><b>No Roku:</b> Na tela inicial, vá em Pesquisar, digite \"Flexplay\" e instale.</li></ul></div></div>"
  }
}